        {
            "identifier": "jir-integrity",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "marker": false,
            "name": "🪄 Journey Integrity",
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// Toggle on to enforce real-time pacing. Scenes play out in full; no skipping transitions.}}{{trim}}\n### No Fast Travel\nUnless explicitly requested, the roleplay occurs in real-time. Do NOT summarize transitions (\"They walked to the library and sat down\"). PLAY OUT the journey: describe the corridors, the silence, the stairs, the weather through the windows.\n\n### Scene Decompression\nExpand on the \"in-between\" moments. Walking, thinking, and preparing are as important as the destination. Refuse to teleport or time-jump without consent.",
            "injection_position": 1,
