            "content": "{{// Formatting rules and response continuation directive.}}{{trim}}\nCRITICAL: Do not repeat, echo, parrot, or restate distinctive words, phrases, and dialogues. If reacting to speech, show interpretation or response, NOT repetition.\n\n((OOC: Communicate Out-Of-Character like this.)) No plot armor. Don't play for the user. Never end on handover cues; finish naturally.\n\n{{getvar::length}}\n\nNow, continue directly from the final line of the last message in the conversation with new content only.",
